come environment, we have reduced our guidance for the year to below 13.6 billion pounds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/03/barclays-plc-bcs-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2019 Q4","e":"bcs","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"For us, I think, as the company sort of completed, if you like, its intensity around restructuring and various other reorganizations that we had to do on the backdrop of changing regulation, ringfencing and CCAR and Brexit and all the kind of good stuff that's gone on there, we're more and more…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/barclays-plc-bcs-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2019 Q4","e":"bcs","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"Now in the past, of course, we've been -- had quite significant conduct litigation-type items that have been running through our capital line item as well as extensive restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/barclays-plc-bcs-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q1","e":"bcs","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jes Staley","x":"That loan means that they can cover running costs, where staff are able to be furloughed rather than laid off.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/barclays-plc-bcs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q1","e":"bcs","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"Costs in the quarter increased 2%, reflecting higher restructuring spend.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/barclays-plc-bcs-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q2","e":"bcs","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"The cost reduction delivered positive jaws of 12% and an improved cost:income ratio of 57%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/barclays-plc-bcs-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q3","e":"bcs","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"The COVID pandemic has resulted in additional costs for the Group in the short term, both direct costs and through the suspension of headcount reductions we had planned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/barclays-plc-bcs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q3","e":"bcs","d":"2020-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jes Staley","x":"Let me start by saying we, as a management team, we put restructuring this bank behind us over a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/23/barclays-plc-bcs-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q4","e":"bcs","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"Structural sort of cost actions is a way of life for us and we don't call it restructuring, we don't put it below the line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/barclays-plc-bcs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2020 Q4","e":"bcs","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Alvaro Serrano","x":"In the past, you've given more specific cost guidance, I realize you've taken some restructuring charges and you've also called out the COVID expenses will remain elevated, I think is the word you used.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/barclays-plc-bcs-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q1","e":"bcs","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"And of course, there's no real estate restructuring in there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/01/barclays-plc-bcs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q1","e":"bcs","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Cant","x":"And just a point of clarification, if we pretend for a moment that the real estate review is not taking place this year, do you still think the costs are higher than 2020 prior to that restructuring item?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/01/barclays-plc-bcs-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q2","e":"bcs","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"This is expected to result in annual cost savings of about GBP50 million from 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/barclays-plc-bcs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q2","e":"bcs","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jes Staley","x":"I'll just step back a little bit. six years ago, we embarked on a pretty extensive restructuring of the bank.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/barclays-plc-bcs-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q3","e":"bcs","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"Which I guess hopefully it's helpful in terms of -- I think that the point of your question was, can you just tell us how much of the Year 1 net interest income sensitivity comes from just base rate rises and pass-through assumptions versus just hedge ROE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/barclays-plc-bcs-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q3","e":"bcs","d":"2021-10-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"I think what -- perhaps what you really sort of maybe looking into is, these pass-through assumptions, will they change as base rates continue to increase?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/21/barclays-plc-bcs-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BCS 2021 Q3","e":"bcs","d":"2021-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tushar Morzaria","x":"You will recall that the latter is expected to result in annual cost s